  WrittenDialogue: "Way to show everyone up.\nYou wanna go with me somewhere? It’s kinda redundant right now.\nLike we could basically drink anywhere.\nUnless we’re in a third world country like Poland.\nHave you seen my pool? It’s indoors and heated!\nOkay not my pool but my parents’ pool.\nAw but I’m also really hungry.\nNot in a fat way but in like a Poland way.\nThey just opened a Chick-Fil-A near me, you wanna go?"
  DialogueCharacterNames: "KELLY\nKELLY\nKELLY\nKELLY\nKELLY\nKELLY\nKELLY\nKELLY\nKELLY"
